  "description": "Remote desktop as a library for .NET. Capture a screen, stream it (JPEG-tile deltas or hardware H.264), and inject the operator's mouse/keyboard back — plus clipboard, file transfer, and audio — over any byte channel you provide (transport-agnostic ISessionChannel). Cross-platform host AND viewer on Windows, Linux, and macOS, using each OS's native H.264 codec (Media Foundation / VA-API / VideoToolbox) with automatic codec negotiation. Embed remote support/control into your own .NET app without bundling a third-party product.",
  "id": "RemoteViewer.SessionKit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-09T19:50:19.7Z",
